    "ClassicPairedV1 is a direct string-only optional enum in all three models; missing/null means None and serializer omits None. The public Rust Peripheral literal shape intentionally changes.",
    "Own ATIM inputs use raw ATIM register identity in data and sanitized Atim identity in Rust; HAL matches the exact enum and register version.",
